[{"client_msg_id":"6c45fb63-a3c2-4e83-a68e-85ef608688b2","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"protobuf で動的生成した rs 読むのに `include!` 使ってたからむっちゃ助かる予感","ts":"1627631787.004200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lZ26T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a32a12ee-307d-4216-bd04-ea9f2b7a98ec","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"大きめのクレートの `\u003chttp://lib.rs|lib.rs\u003e` とか9割以上が doc comment で、肝心のコード部分を探すのに苦労する、みたいなことありますからね。\nREADME みたいな md ファイルを参照できるようになったのはありがたい。","ts":"1627630231.003500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U776661HA","U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kUo+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0241bec-b286-4ed7-a677-a35080534a6b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ドキュメントの統合と分離という意味でありがたいですよね","ts":"1627630145.002300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UACD9MGA1"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1ULH4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5796e1c6-ad46-442c-aae0-2525e11c48db","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"```// \u003chttp://lib.rs|lib.rs\u003e\n\n// ここでREADME.mdの内容がクレートのドキュメントとして取り込まれる。\n#![doc = include_str!(\"README.md\")]```\n","ts":"1627630112.001800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FZbO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1db67a3e-941c-4e1b-a4a2-c0c4eb474e4d","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"まったく同じのをはろうとしたw\n\u0026gt; 一部の属性内で値としてマクロを使えるようになった\n\u0026gt;  README.mdを取り込むことでドキュメントの整備が簡単になります。\nこれ便利ですね","ts":"1627630100.001600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=p86"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89244010-fbbd-4d71-a0d9-b94ace5841e4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://tech-blog.optim.co.jp/entry/2021/07/30/080000\u